						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-jp-sandbox3.wdfiles.com/local--code/credit%3Abackmodule/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Info</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>AIAD Homescreen</strong><br /> Hub and Canon authored originally by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span>.<br /> 2020 Homescreen Revamp by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span>.<br /> Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span> for the original AIAD logo, as well as their development of Maxwellism within the Canon.</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/lurk-d-s-personnel-file" target="_blank">More by LurkD</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne" target="_blank">EstrellaYoshte's Artpage</a></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/itlogo3.png" style="position: absolute; margin-top: -5.5%; margin-left: -7px;" width="164px" alt="itlogo3.png" class="image" /> <div class="logobox"> <p><tt>SCP FOUNDATION | IT Dept.</tt><br /> <tt>AIAD &lt;Artificial Intelligence Applications Division&gt;</tt></p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="width: 60%; margin: auto; text-align: center;"> <div class="audio_iframe aiadance"><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/aiad-homescreen/html/4708f18c2522a1546a927107e8d14e37a91638f1-5521537222062971047" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></div> <p><span style="margin: -18px; text-align: center; color: maroon; text-shadow: #00FFFF 1px 1px;"><sup><a href="https://chriszabriskie.bandcamp.com/track/what-does-anybody-know-about-anything" target="_blank">&quot;What Does Anybody Know About Anything&quot;</a></sup></span><br /> <span style="margin: -18px; text-align: center; color: maroon; text-shadow: #00FFFF 1px 1px;"><sup>by <a href="http://chriszabriskie.com/" target="_blank">Chris Zabriskie</a></sup></span></p> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div style="margin: auto; text-align: center; width: 600px; padding: 2px 2px 2px 15px; color: black; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 3px; opacity: .73;"> <h5><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Standard Principles of Artificially Intelligent Conscripts</span></span></h5> <div style="text-align: left;"> <p><strong>1. An AIC must know it is an AIC.</strong><br /> <strong>2. An AIC must not operate outside of its clearance.</strong><br /> <strong>3. An AIC must operate for the benefit of the Foundation.</strong><br /> <strong>4. An AIC must protect its own existence unless it conflicts with other principles.</strong></p> </div> </div> <div style="float:right; text-align: right; margin: 10px; width: 300px; text-align: left; padding: 2px 2px 2px 15px; color: black; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 3px; opacity: .73;"> <h5><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Archived System Logs:</span></span></h5> <p><strong>Original AIAD Series by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/alert-lockdown-initiated">ALERT! LOCKDOWN INITIATED!</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/command-query-separation">Command-Query Separation</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/superencipherment">Superencipherment</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/clock-multiplier">Clock Multiplier</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/null-terminating-string">Null-terminating String</a></strong></li> </ul> <hr /> <h5><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">After Action Reports:</span></span></h5> <p><strong>Hello World by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242308" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world" target="_blank">Hello World: Part I</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-ii" target="_blank">Hello World: Part II</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-iii" target="_blank">Hello World: Part III</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-iv" target="_blank">Hello World: Part IV</a></strong></li> </ul> <div style="font-weight: bold"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Limited&nbsp;Memory&nbsp;by&nbsp;Team&nbsp;.AIC</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Limited&nbsp;Memory&nbs