-homescreen/Thorn.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> 8-ball1.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> 8-Ball<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/8-ball1.png">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/8-ball1.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> glacon_00.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Glacon<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/glacon_00.png">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/glacon_00.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> hatbot1.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> hatbot<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/hatbot1.png">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/hatbot1.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> mnemosyne.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Mnemosyne<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/mnemosyne.png">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/mnemosyne.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> crom3.png, crom_tr_flip.png, crom_tr.png, crom_turntr.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> CROM (and variants)<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/crom3.png">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/crom3.png</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> 18-1.gif<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> loading<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/18-1.gif">http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/18-1.gif</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> </div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-588033-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Large typewriter devices that string together text and antimemetic ciphers to encrypt written messages, allowing only the intended recipient to read it and remember it.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-588033-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Which were seemingly technophobic in retrospect.</div> </div> 
