					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5498</guid>
				<title>SCP-5498</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5498</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item # :&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5498&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; No physical contact may be made with SCP-5498 for any reason. Anything making physical contact with SCP-5498 must be contained in quarantine immediately, along with the materials used in the transport of the subject.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5498 must be contained in an aluminum sealed container all the time even in transporting the subject.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5498 appears to a rusted tin can approximately 11cm tall and 7cm wide. Any objects coming in contact with SCP-5498 will begin to corrode after 36 hours (1.5 days). This effect will occur on any material other than aluminum.&lt;br /&gt;
The corrosion will spread approximately 0.45cm (4.5mm) per 10 seconds and will convert the entire object or organism, inside and out. Subjects report this effect to be extremely painful like tearing off your skin. After complete corrosion, the object will stop moving for approximately sixty-seven seconds, before completely breaking down into hundreds of fragments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anything touched by or touching a fragment will immediately begin to corrode, the same effects will also happen to the object that touched a fragment. SCP-5000 was recovered ██████████, under the dead body of a corroded horse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5498-1:&lt;/strong&gt; During the recovery in ██████████, Agent ███████ ██████, and Agent&lt;br /&gt;
█████ ███were exposed to the effects of SCP-5498-1, and both were severely &amp;quot;corroded&amp;quot;, After&lt;br /&gt;
that, they were both treated with SCP-500, and a complete recovery was achieved in 13 days.&lt;br /&gt;
Subjects report that the pain of tearing off your skin stops after 2 days of being treated with SCP-500&lt;br /&gt;
but their immobility lasts 45 days after being treated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/montom27&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7083563&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607242309&quot; alt=&quot;montom27&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7083563)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/montom27&quot;  &gt;montom27&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
