&lt;td style=&quot;width: 75%; background-color: #f0f0f0; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;That&#039;s probably doable. We have some of the prototypes for my chair over in storage. I can release a few of the more finished ones to your department. Do you have a cost analysis done yet?&lt;/td&gt;
